        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up at a battered kitchen table in a cramped apartment somewhere in the neon future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your head hurts, your memory is full of gaps, and the city outside sounds like a machine grinding its teeth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the table sits a girl you do not recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your implants and files say she is your girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gut says you have never seen her before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game unfolds in this one room, in real time, as you talk to her, test your memories and push against the seams of reality. The more you question what is happening, the more the world around the table begins to glitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, story focused visual novel about trust, guilt and how far a corporation will go to rewrite a human mind.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up at a battered kitchen table in a cramped apartment somewhere in the neon future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your head hurts, your memory is full of gaps, and the city outside sounds like a machine grinding its teeth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the table sits a girl you do not recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your implants and files say she is your girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gut says you have never seen her before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game unfolds in this one room, in real time, as you talk to her, test your memories and push against the seams of reality. The more you question what is happening, the more the world around the table begins to glitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, story focused visual novel about trust, guilt and how far a corporation will go to rewrite a human mind.</p>",
